[{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0565","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0565.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-1561","title":"Debian Linux Xvt 本地缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"Xvt 2.1 存在本地缓冲区溢出漏洞，该漏洞影响 Debian Linux 2.2 系统。本地攻击者可通过向 Xvt 程序的 -name 和 -T 命令行参数传递超长字符串触发缓冲区溢出，从而在目标系统上以当前用户权限执行任意代码。CVSS 评分 7.2，危害等级高。Debian 已发布安全公告 DSA-082 修复此漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2001-1561"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-12-31T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:56:30Z","remediation":"升级 xvt 至 2.1-13.0potato.1 或更高版本。Debian 2.2 (potato) 用户可通过 apt-get update && apt-get upgrade xvt 安装安全更新，或从 security.debian.org 下载对应架构的 deb 包手动安装。如无法升级，建议移除 xvt 的 setuid 位（chmod u-s /usr/bin/xvt）以降低本地提权风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2001-07/0024.html","http://www.debian.org/security/2001/dsa-082","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/6781.php","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2955","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2964","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20986","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/2786c0581d3fd3239f3f8ab3739b9b784dba4433/cves/2001/1xxx/CVE-2001-1561.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-1561","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/47b3b393e16caede3350b5302035c4ef73c36bc7/2001/1xxx/CVE-2001-1561.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/ad8af7b6d55e05f22d7ff67c808ccd8d54c89d32/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-1561.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/c55392b715d0e2e1caa8bc26997a940be7494a13/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-pvjj-qg62-4h42/GHSA-pvjj-qg62-4h42.json","https://github.com/zercurity/vulnerabilities/blob/8eb5f158d91688a46557263c708774d5f8d3956c/2001/CVE-2001-1561","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/c54e59752dddfc9aa36c13774164384cfa0d1f04/content/CVE-2001-1561.md","https://github.com/blackhook/nessus-plugins/blob/64177d96abbb07c58cf7e131046b067ebc61fcb5/D/debian_DSA-082.nasl","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-1561.json","https://github.com/debiancn/debian.org/blob/6abc98daa6356b20e410013a6920b3764af682d4/english/security/2001/dsa-082.data"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0565.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0564","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0564.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-1560","title":"Microsoft Windows 2000/XP GDI 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Windows 2000 和 Windows XP 系统中的 Win32k.sys（图形设备接口 GDI）存在拒绝服务漏洞。本地用户可通过在收到 WM_NCCREATE 消息后调用 ShowWindow 函数，触发内核模式下的空指针解引用，导致系统崩溃（蓝屏）。该漏洞攻击条件简单，无需特殊权限即可利用，但仅限于本地攻击场景，无法远程触发。","severity":"LOW","score":2.1,"aliases":["CVE-2001-1560"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-12-31T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:56:30Z","remediation":"Windows 2000 和 Windows XP 均已停止支持，微软不再提供安全更新。建议立即升级至 Windows 10/11 或 Windows Server 2019/2022 等受支持版本。如无法升级，可通过限制本地用户登录权限、禁用不受信任用户交互式登录来降低本地攻击面。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.derkeiler.com/Mailing-Lists/NT-Bugtraq/2001-10/0066.html","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/7409.php","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/3481","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21131","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/2786c0581d3fd3239f3f8ab3739b9b784dba4433/cves/2001/1xxx/CVE-2001-1560.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-1560","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/47b3b393e16caede3350b5302035c4ef73c36bc7/2001/1xxx/CVE-2001-1560.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/ad8af7b6d55e05f22d7ff67c808ccd8d54c89d32/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-1560.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/c55392b715d0e2e1caa8bc26997a940be7494a13/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-hgpj-jvr6-r6hw/GHSA-hgpj-jvr6-r6hw.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/c54e59752dddfc9aa36c13774164384cfa0d1f04/content/CVE-2001-1560.md","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152000_152100.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_1.list.dict","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--e43898b7-0491-468a-9f56-f7fc3d420ba6.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2001-1560.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0564.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0563","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0563.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-1559","title":"OpenBSD 2.9/3.0 uipc系统调用用户态返回值空指针解引用拒绝服务漏洞","description":"OpenBSD 2.9 和 3.0 版本的 uipc 系统调用（uipc_syscalls.c）在向 fdrelease 函数传递返回值时错误地使用了用户模式返回值而非内核模式 rval 值，导致空指针解引用漏洞。本地攻击者只需拥有低权限账户即可利用该漏洞触发系统拒绝服务，造成目标系统崩溃。该漏洞影响 OpenBSD 2.9 及 3.0 版本，攻击复杂度低，无需用户交互。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2001-1559"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-12-31T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:56:30Z","remediation":"升级 OpenBSD 至 3.1 或更高版本，该漏洞已在后续版本的内核中修复。如无法升级，可下载 OpenBSD 3.0 的 013_pipe.patch 内核补丁（位于 ftp.openbsd.org/pub/OpenBSD/patches/3.0/common/），以 root 权限执行 `patch -p0 < 013_pipe.patch` 后重新编译内核并重启。作为临时缓解措施，可限制不可信用户的本地登录权限，减少攻击面。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2001-12/0014.html","http://monkey.org/openbsd/archive/tech/0112/msg00015.html","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/7690.php","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21167","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/2786c0581d3fd3239f3f8ab3739b9b784dba4433/cves/2001/1xxx/CVE-2001-1559.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-1559","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/47b3b393e16caede3350b5302035c4ef73c36bc7/2001/1xxx/CVE-2001-1559.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/ad8af7b6d55e05f22d7ff67c808ccd8d54c89d32/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-1559.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/c55392b715d0e2e1caa8bc26997a940be7494a13/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-c4g9-53v4-f2qg/GHSA-c4g9-53v4-f2qg.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/c54e59752dddfc9aa36c13774164384cfa0d1f04/content/CVE-2001-1559.md","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cwe_details/cwe_details_300_400.json","https://github.com/Team-Atlanta/aixcc-asc-atlantis/blob/785c446f980e12155935db586aa30c3b54adcc86/crs/src/crs-patch/smith/smith/lib/cwe/raw/CWE-393.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-1559.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--554d54f1-467e-4fa6-ae18-36a87bcd90c2.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0563.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0562","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0562.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-1549","title":"ZoneAlarm Tiny Personal Firewall 本地过滤绕过漏洞","description":"Tiny Personal Firewall 1.0 及 2.0 版本（即 ZoneAlarm Pro 1.0/2.x）存在出站数据包绕过漏洞。本地用户可通过非 Windows 协议适配器构造非标准 TCP 数据包，从而绕过防火墙的出站过滤规则，导致受保护的计算机在用户未授权的情况下向外发送数据。该漏洞攻击条件要求攻击者具有本地系统访问权限，利用难度低，仅影响系统完整性，不涉及机密性和可用性。CVSS 评分 2.1，危害等级低。","severity":"LOW","score":2.1,"aliases":["CVE-2001-1549"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-12-31T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:56:29Z","remediation":"该漏洞为 2001 年披露的旧版个人防火墙设计缺陷，Tiny Personal Firewall 1.0/2.0 及 ZoneAlarm Pro 1.0/2.x 均已停止维护，厂商不再提供安全更新。建议立即卸载上述过期版本，升级至 ZoneAlarm 最新版本（当前为 ZoneAlarm Extreme Security）或改用 Windows 内置防火墙（Windows Defender Firewall），并启用出站规则默认阻止模式。同时限制本地管理员权限，仅授予可信用户，防止非标准协议适配器被用于构造绕过数据包。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2001-12/0056.html","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/7671.php","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/3647","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21169","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/2786c0581d3fd3239f3f8ab3739b9b784dba4433/cves/2001/1xxx/CVE-2001-1549.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-1549","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/47b3b393e16caede3350b5302035c4ef73c36bc7/2001/1xxx/CVE-2001-1549.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/ad8af7b6d55e05f22d7ff67c808ccd8d54c89d32/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-1549.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/c55392b715d0e2e1caa8bc26997a940be7494a13/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-xgj9-vjq9-qmrc/GHSA-xgj9-vjq9-qmrc.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/c54e59752dddfc9aa36c13774164384cfa0d1f04/content/CVE-2001-1549.md","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152000_152100.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_1.list.dict","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2001-1549.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--afeebef8-e44f-4c4e-b3c7-036591917a7d.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2001/POC-AVE-2001-0562.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0562.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0561","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0561.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-1546","title":"McKesson Pathways Homecare 弱密码加密导致本地权限提升漏洞","description":"McKesson Pathways Homecare 6.5 对用户名和密码采用弱加密算法存储，本地攻击者可通过读取 pwhc.ini 配置文件中的加密凭据，利用弱加密的脆弱性还原明文密码，从而获取更高权限。该漏洞影响 McKesson Pathways Homecare 6.5 版本，攻击者需具备本地系统访问权限及低权限用户身份，无需用户交互即可利用。CVSS 评分 7.8，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.8,"aliases":["CVE-2001-1546"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-12-31T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:56:28Z","remediation":"立即限制对 pwhc.ini 文件的访问权限，仅允许系统管理员账户读取该文件（如设置 NTFS 权限为 SYSTEM 和 Administrators 完全控制，拒绝普通用户读取）。由于 McKesson Pathways Homecare 6.5 已停止维护，建议升级到支持强加密（如 AES-256）的最新版本或替换为其他合规的医疗信息管理系统。如无法升级，应使用组策略限制本地用户登录到运行该软件的终端，并启用 Windows 审核策略监控对 pwhc.ini 的异常访问。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/7682.php","http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/244367","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/3653","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21173","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/2786c0581d3fd3239f3f8ab3739b9b784dba4433/cves/2001/1xxx/CVE-2001-1546.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-1546","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/e1d7afb428742628d991f2465e712a059beb8d79/2001/1xxx/CVE-2001-1546.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/47b3b393e16caede3350b5302035c4ef73c36bc7/2001/1xxx/CVE-2001-1546.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/c55392b715d0e2e1caa8bc26997a940be7494a13/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-pc4p-7w58-pgg2/GHSA-pc4p-7w58-pgg2.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/c54e59752dddfc9aa36c13774164384cfa0d1f04/content/CVE-2001-1546.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/ad8af7b6d55e05f22d7ff67c808ccd8d54c89d32/SSVC/data/2001/CVE-2001-1546.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cwe_details/cwe_details_400_500.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_2.list.dict","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Exploit-List-Ja/blob/b82432e7d59d95db9f183c0cefa7744595784afa/2001.tsv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0561.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0560","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0560.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-1528","title":"AmTote International Homebet 账户信息暴力破解漏洞","description":"AmTote International 的 Homebet 在线投注程序存在信息泄露漏洞。由于系统在用户输入无效账号和无效 PIN 码时返回不同的错误提示信息，远程攻击者可通过暴力枚举方式，根据服务器返回的差异区分出有效账号。该漏洞允许攻击者收集有效账户信息，为后续进一步攻击（如密码爆破）创造条件，影响系统账户安全性和用户隐私。官方未提供补丁，建议通过统一错误提示信息进行缓解。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-1528"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-12-31T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:56:26Z","remediation":"AmTote International 已停止维护该产品，无官方补丁。建议修改应用逻辑，对无效账号和无效 PIN 返回相同的通用错误提示（如\"账号或 PIN 不正确\"），避免通过错误信息差异枚举有效账号；同时在应用层增加登录失败次数限制和临时锁定机制，降低暴力破解效率。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2001-09/0235.html","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/7185.php","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/3371","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21116","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/2786c0581d3fd3239f3f8ab3739b9b784dba4433/cves/2001/1xxx/CVE-2001-1528.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-1528","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/47b3b393e16caede3350b5302035c4ef73c36bc7/2001/1xxx/CVE-2001-1528.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/ad8af7b6d55e05f22d7ff67c808ccd8d54c89d32/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-1528.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/c55392b715d0e2e1caa8bc26997a940be7494a13/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-m9j4-rc9x-qfm5/GHSA-m9j4-rc9x-qfm5.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/c54e59752dddfc9aa36c13774164384cfa0d1f04/content/CVE-2001-1528.md","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cwe_details/cwe_details_500_600.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-1528.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--102e0b54-75ec-479c-93d0-9aac64ba5d03.json","https://github.com/fklement/acema_oran/blob/096561d274c61aab60b54a37c9ceb0c29a73e6fb/O-Cloud%20-%20Data%20Gathering.ipynb"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2001/POC-AVE-2001-0560.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0560.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0559","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0559.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-1525","title":"EasyNews 1.5 目录遍历漏洞","description":"EasyNews 1.5 及更早版本中存在目录遍历漏洞，位于 comments 操作的 cid 参数中。远程攻击者无需身份认证即可通过向 cid 参数传入包含 \"..\" 的恶意路径，利用目录遍历技术越权访问服务器文件系统，进而修改 news.dat、template.dat 等关键配置文件。该漏洞影响 EasyNews 1.5 及之前所有版本，CVSS 评分 5.0，危害等级中等，攻击复杂度低，可导致系统配置被篡改，影响网站正常运行。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-1525"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-12-31T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:56:26Z","remediation":"立即升级 easyNews 至 1.5 以上版本（如官方已停止维护，建议迁移至其他活跃维护的新闻管理系统）。若无法升级，在 index.php 的 comments 动作处理 cid 参数时，过滤 `../` 及空字节等目录遍历字符，仅允许纯数字或字母输入；同时将 news.dat、template.dat 等关键文件的权限设为 0444（只读），并确保 Web 服务器运行用户对这些文件无写入权限。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2001-12/0000.html","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/7657.php","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/3643","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21168","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/933422a5f82611777877a3549b9b8e3c7d70117d/cves/2001/1xxx/CVE-2001-1525.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-1525","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/47b3b393e16caede3350b5302035c4ef73c36bc7/2001/1xxx/CVE-2001-1525.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/ad8af7b6d55e05f22d7ff67c808ccd8d54c89d32/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-1525.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/c55392b715d0e2e1caa8bc26997a940be7494a13/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-2c3m-3322-9m2r/GHSA-2c3m-3322-9m2r.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-1525.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152000_152100.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_2.list.dict","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--79c0dc55-91ad-4fac-ad12-ad437b478a77.json","https://github.com/Yuning-J/VulnerabilityClassifier/blob/c0f06c21b73c26b5ee2b75c21a498eb04eada4b5/threatPrediction/cveIDThreatType/cve_iddirtra"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0559.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0558","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0558.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-1524","title":"PHP-Nuke 跨站脚本漏洞","description":"PHP-Nuke 5.3.1 及更早版本中存在跨站脚本（XSS）漏洞，远程攻击者可通过向 user.php 的 uname 参数、modules.php 的 ttitle/letter/file 参数、submit.php 的 subject/story/storyext 参数、admin.php 的 upload 参数以及 friend.php 的 fname 参数注入恶意 Web 脚本或 HTML 代码，在受害者浏览器中执行任意脚本，导致敏感信息泄露（如会话 Cookie 窃取）。攻击者无需身份认证，仅需诱使用户点击特制链接即可触发，影响范围包括 PHP-Nuke 1.0 至 5.3.1 全系列版本。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.3,"aliases":["CVE-2001-1524"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-12-31T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:56:26Z","remediation":"升级 PHP-Nuke 至 7.3 或更高版本（若仍在使用），该版本修复了 user.php、modules.php、submit.php、admin.php 和 friend.php 中多处跨站脚本漏洞。由于 PHP-Nuke 已停止维护，建议立即迁移至现代 CMS（如 WordPress 或 Joomla）。临时缓解措施：在 Web 服务器层面（如 Apache mod_security）对 uname、ttitle、letter、file、subject、story、storyext、upload、fname 等参数实施输入过滤，禁止 <script> 等 HTML 标签。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://online.securityfocus.com/archive/1/245691","http://online.securityfocus.com/archive/1/245875","http://online.securityfocus.com/archive/82/243545","http://online.securityfocus.com/archive/82/246603","http://prdownloads.sourceforge.net/phpnuke/PHP-Nuke-5.5.tar.gz","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/7654.php","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/3609","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21165","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/933422a5f82611777877a3549b9b8e3c7d70117d/cves/2001/1xxx/CVE-2001-1524.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-1524","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/47b3b393e16caede3350b5302035c4ef73c36bc7/2001/1xxx/CVE-2001-1524.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/ad8af7b6d55e05f22d7ff67c808ccd8d54c89d32/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-1524.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/c55392b715d0e2e1caa8bc26997a940be7494a13/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-gr63-v8qw-4wjf/GHSA-gr63-v8qw-4wjf.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/c54e59752dddfc9aa36c13774164384cfa0d1f04/content/CVE-2001-1524.md","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152000_152100.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--a580cf09-2636-4fb0-8eb2-9f124d0d5aff.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-1524.json","https://github.com/gyro2077/taller-pruebas-unitarias-chili-ferrin-sanmartin/blob/9a6eff6dafcb1c5bd9b2088622d4610fa1b23603/SALIDA.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0558.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0557","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0557.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-1519","title":"Microsoft Windows 2000 RunAs 服务命名管道劫持漏洞","description":"Windows 2000 的 RunAs 服务（runas.exe）存在命名管道劫持漏洞。当 RunAs 服务停止时，本地攻击者可在系统上创建伪造的命名管道，当其他客户端连接该服务时，攻击者能够捕获通过管道传输的明文用户名和密码。该漏洞影响 Windows 2000 系统，攻击者需具备本地系统访问权限。厂商对此存在争议，认为利用该漏洞已需要管理员权限。Exploit-DB 上已有公开的利用代码。","severity":"LOW","score":3.6,"aliases":["CVE-2001-1519"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-12-31T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:56:25Z","remediation":"建议立即升级至受支持的 Windows 版本（如 Windows 10/11 或 Windows Server 2019+），Windows 2000 已停止支持且无官方补丁。如无法升级，严格限制本地登录用户仅为受信任管理员，通过组策略禁止普通用户交互式登录；同时禁用 RunAs 服务或使用防火墙限制本地管道通信作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://online.securityfocus.com/archive/1/236111","http://online.securityfocus.com/archive/1/240136","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/7532.php","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/3185","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21069","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/be44b05b9428dc18bc0705cf60dd8d8640cd49b1/2001/CVE-2001-1519.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/933422a5f82611777877a3549b9b8e3c7d70117d/cves/2001/1xxx/CVE-2001-1519.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-1519","https://github.com/krafthack-by-techday/Night-s-watch/blob/30ae1bcc335306fe4c5507b2c629cae4932e515e/cve/nvd/CVE-2001-1519_ee678f5b-88fc-44ae-8b2a-713f3b5f4486","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/ad8af7b6d55e05f22d7ff67c808ccd8d54c89d32/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-1519.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2001/CVE-2001-1519.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/c55392b715d0e2e1caa8bc26997a940be7494a13/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-6f73-68xp-2x5w/GHSA-6f73-68xp-2x5w.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-1519.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/47b3b393e16caede3350b5302035c4ef73c36bc7/2001/1xxx/CVE-2001-1519.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/6407d36596f98bb612d3683e11380f7f08452c58/2001.tsv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0557.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0556","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0556.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-1518","title":"Microsoft Windows 2000 RunAs 服务拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Windows 2000 的 RunAs（runas.exe）服务在运行时仅维护单个会话实例，本地攻击者可通过与认证服务器建立命名管道会话但不发送任何服务请求的方式，耗尽 RunAs 的会话处理能力，导致该服务挂起（拒绝服务）。该漏洞攻击复杂度低，无需身份认证即可触发，但需要本地访问权限。厂商虽曾争议其危害性，但在终端服务器场景下确实可影响其他用户。CVSS 评分 2.1，危害等级低。","severity":"LOW","score":2.1,"aliases":["CVE-2001-1518"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-12-31T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:56:25Z","remediation":"Windows 2000 已停止支持，建议升级至 Windows 10/11 或 Windows Server 2019/2022 等受支持版本。如无法升级，可通过组策略限制非授权用户的本地交互登录权限，并禁用 RunAs 服务的网络访问。临时缓解措施：在注册表 `HKLM\\SOFTWARE\\Microsoft\\Windows NT\\CurrentVersion\\RunAs` 中限制同时运行实例数。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://cert.uni-stuttgart.de/archive/bugtraq/2001/11/msg00100.html","http://online.securityfocus.com/archive/1/236113","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/7533.php","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/3291","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21099","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/933422a5f82611777877a3549b9b8e3c7d70117d/cves/2001/1xxx/CVE-2001-1518.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-1518","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/56ecbe5708e7172ccdeffde501e0321bbd31bea6/2001/1xxx/CVE-2001-1518.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/68711f4b9de04c730603adbbe0fe7b126b6784b4/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-1518.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/effb2f348554323580d029ec0e691334888b7fed/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-7vj4-8vxm-9cjx/GHSA-7vj4-8vxm-9cjx.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/c54e59752dddfc9aa36c13774164384cfa0d1f04/content/CVE-2001-1518.md","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152000_152100.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--6456e9bb-05cb-4d9f-bcfd-85d9e1471691.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2001-1518.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/02c5860afb8ff485c42f02971eeee1e26d438da2/2001.tsv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0556.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0555","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0555.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-1502","title":"Mountain Network Systems WebCart 8.4 命令执行漏洞","description":"Mountain Network Systems WebCart 8.4 的 webcart.cgi 脚本存在命令执行漏洞，远程攻击者可通过向 NEXTPAGE 参数注入 shell 元字符（如管道符、分号等）触发该漏洞，在服务器上以 Web 服务进程权限执行任意系统命令。该漏洞影响 WebCart 8.4 版本，攻击无需身份认证，利用复杂度低，可导致敏感信息泄露、网站篡改或进一步渗透内网。ExploitDB 已公开该漏洞的利用代码。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2001-1502"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-12-31T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:56:23Z","remediation":"立即删除或禁用 webcart.cgi 脚本，或限制其仅允许内部访问。在 Web 服务器层面（如 Apache mod_rewrite 或 WAF 规则）过滤 NEXTPAGE 参数中的 shell 元字符（; | & ` $）。建议迁移至受支持的现代电子商务平台，因 Mountain Network Systems 已停止维护 WebCart 产品。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/221688","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/3453","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/7315","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21125","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/933422a5f82611777877a3549b9b8e3c7d70117d/cves/2001/1xxx/CVE-2001-1502.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-1502","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/56ecbe5708e7172ccdeffde501e0321bbd31bea6/2001/1xxx/CVE-2001-1502.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/68711f4b9de04c730603adbbe0fe7b126b6784b4/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-1502.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/effb2f348554323580d029ec0e691334888b7fed/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-v544-569m-qr97/GHSA-v544-569m-qr97.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/c54e59752dddfc9aa36c13774164384cfa0d1f04/content/CVE-2001-1502.md","https://github.com/xqcyberscore/nvt/blob/978f6a9acb495d7d669239530ffe6da5d631f4da/pre2008/webcart_cmd_exec.nasl","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2001-1502.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_0.list.dict","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Exploit-List-Ja/blob/b82432e7d59d95db9f183c0cefa7744595784afa/2001.tsv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0555.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0554","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0554.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-1501","title":"ProFTPD 1.2.1 glob 通配符拒绝服务漏洞","description":"ProFTPD 1.2.1 及其他版本（包括 WU-FTPD 2.4/2.5/2.6、Trolltech ftpd 1.2、BeroFTPD 1.3.4）的 glob 通配符扩展功能存在拒绝服务漏洞。远程未经认证的攻击者可通过向 FTP 服务器发送包含大量通配符及特殊字符的 ls 命令（如构造多个 \"*/..\"、\"*/.*\" 或 \".*./*?/\" 序列），触发服务器过度消耗 CPU 和内存资源，导致服务崩溃或无法响应正常请求。该漏洞无需身份认证即可远程利用，影响范围广泛。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-1501"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-12-31T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:56:23Z","remediation":"升级 ProFTPD 至 1.2.5 及以上版本（1.2.5rc1 已修复该漏洞）；WU-FTPD 升级至 2.6.2 以上，BeroFTPD 升级至 1.3.5 以上。在 proftpd.conf 中设置 MaxClients 和 MaxInstances 限制并发连接数，并限制匿名用户的目录遍历权限以降低攻击面。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://distro.conectiva.com.br/atualizacoes/?id=a&anuncio=000450","http://online.securityfocus.com/archive/1/169395","http://www.mandriva.com/security/advisories?name=MDKSA-2002:005","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20690","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/145038fbd12ba507a810d82f3ca7bed9554ecf9f/cves/2001/1xxx/CVE-2001-1501.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-1501","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/56ecbe5708e7172ccdeffde501e0321bbd31bea6/2001/1xxx/CVE-2001-1501.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/68711f4b9de04c730603adbbe0fe7b126b6784b4/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-1501.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/effb2f348554323580d029ec0e691334888b7fed/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-8826-pg9p-3pqq/GHSA-8826-pg9p-3pqq.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/c54e59752dddfc9aa36c13774164384cfa0d1f04/content/CVE-2001-1501.md","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cwe_details/cwe_details_500_600.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x90000/89750/info.html","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-1501.json","https://github.com/blackhook/nessus-plugins/blob/64177d96abbb07c58cf7e131046b067ebc61fcb5/M/mandrake_MDKSA-2002-005.nasl"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0554.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0553","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0553.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-1491","title":"Opera Web Browser 图片数量拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Opera 5.11 及更早版本在处理包含大量图片的网页时存在拒绝服务漏洞。远程攻击者可通过构造包含大量图片元素的恶意网页，诱使用户访问后触发该漏洞，导致浏览器 CPU 占用率飙升及内存泄漏，最终造成浏览器崩溃或系统资源耗尽。该漏洞影响 Opera 5.11、Microsoft Internet Explorer 6.0 及 Mozilla 0.9.6 等浏览器，攻击条件低，无需身份认证即可远程利用。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-1491"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-12-31T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:56:22Z","remediation":"升级 Opera 浏览器至 6.0 及以上版本，或升级 Internet Explorer 至 6.0 SP1 及以上版本，或升级 Mozilla 至 1.0 及以上版本。临时缓解措施：在浏览器设置中禁用自动加载图片功能，或使用内容过滤插件限制单页面图片加载数量。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/245152","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/3684","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/7709","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21181","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/145038fbd12ba507a810d82f3ca7bed9554ecf9f/cves/2001/1xxx/CVE-2001-1491.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-1491","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/56ecbe5708e7172ccdeffde501e0321bbd31bea6/2001/1xxx/CVE-2001-1491.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/68711f4b9de04c730603adbbe0fe7b126b6784b4/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-1491.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/effb2f348554323580d029ec0e691334888b7fed/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-6g54-4c8f-fc5g/GHSA-6g54-4c8f-fc5g.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-1491.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_151900_152000.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--3212fdc7-d7f9-45b1-8703-bd2dbc6b648a.json","https://github.com/hungryfoolou/Vulnerability_Mining/blob/3df1d8ed0489ae1228f975ae1f58a690aae53886/craw/cveid_craw/cveid_craw/data/cveid_by_kind/cveid_dos.txt","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/c54e59752dddfc9aa36c13774164384cfa0d1f04/content/CVE-2001-1491.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2001/POC-AVE-2001-0553.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2001/EXP-AVE-2001-0553.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0553.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0552","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0552.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-1487","title":"Qualcomm Qpopper 4.0.x PopAuth 符号链接文件覆盖与命令执行漏洞","description":"Qualcomm Qpopper 4.0 及更早版本中的 popauth 实用程序存在符号链接（symlink）攻击漏洞。本地攻击者可通过向 popauth 的 -trace 文件选项传递特制的符号链接，利用 popauth 以 pop 用户权限处理 trace 文件时的路径跟随缺陷，实现覆盖任意文件或以 pop 用户身份执行任意命令。该漏洞需要攻击者拥有本地系统访问权限，无需认证即可利用，可导致本地权限提升或敏感信息泄露。CVSS 评分 4.6，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.6,"aliases":["CVE-2001-1487"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-12-31T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:56:22Z","remediation":"升级 QPopper 至 4.1 及以上版本，该版本已修复 popauth 对 -trace 文件参数处理不当导致的符号链接跟随问题。如无法升级，可移除 popauth 的 setuid 位（chmod u-s /usr/sbin/popauth），或限制仅授权管理员可通过 popauth 使用 -trace 选项，并确保 trace 文件写入专用目录而非用户可控路径。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/246069","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/7707","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21185","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/145038fbd12ba507a810d82f3ca7bed9554ecf9f/cves/2001/1xxx/CVE-2001-1487.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-1487","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/56ecbe5708e7172ccdeffde501e0321bbd31bea6/2001/1xxx/CVE-2001-1487.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/68711f4b9de04c730603adbbe0fe7b126b6784b4/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-1487.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/effb2f348554323580d029ec0e691334888b7fed/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-rvjm-fwh9-c97h/GHSA-rvjm-fwh9-c97h.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-1487.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x89000/88705/info.html","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_151900_152000.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--76aaa8b0-467f-47b4-9a2d-5ae5ce8ac41c.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/c54e59752dddfc9aa36c13774164384cfa0d1f04/content/CVE-2001-1487.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0552.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0543","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0543.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-1572","title":"Linux Netfilter MAC地址过滤绕过漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 2.4.1 至 2.4.11 版本的 Netfilter MAC 模块存在安全漏洞。当系统配置 Netfilter 基于 MAC 地址进行过滤时，远程攻击者可通过发送特制的小包绕过过滤规则，导致系统安全检查失效，可能影响数据的机密性、完整性和可用性。该漏洞源于内核 MAC 地址处理逻辑中的边界检查不足，攻击者无需认证即可远程利用，CVSS 评分 7.5。Linux 社区已在后续内核版本中修复此漏洞，建议用户升级至 2.4.12 或更高版本以获取完整保护。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2001-1572"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2001-12-31T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:56:31Z","remediation":"建议立即升级 Linux 内核至 2.4.12 或更高版本（受影响版本为 2.4.1 至 2.4.11）。Red Hat 用户可应用 RHSA-2003-195 安全更新（kernel-2.4.20-8 及以上）。如无法立即升级内核，可暂时在 iptables 中禁用 MAC 地址过滤规则（删除使用 -m mac 的规则）作为临时缓解措施，并改用 IP 地址或端口过滤替代。建议尽快安装发行版提供的内核安全补丁包并重启系统使其生效。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2001-10/0057.html","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/7267.php","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/3418","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/7102a069678e6b88d270e4c0da51e40aee59b148/cves/2001/1xxx/CVE-2001-1572.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-1572","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/56ecbe5708e7172ccdeffde501e0321bbd31bea6/2001/1xxx/CVE-2001-1572.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/5acf8b684d0e9ea76142eea6cd4851531d4ab2af/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-1572.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/d91e95989ea5d3a9186ceb621d53a71dff03cab4/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-3rmp-rcwp-h568/GHSA-3rmp-rcwp-h568.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/c54e59752dddfc9aa36c13774164384cfa0d1f04/content/CVE-2001-1572.md","https://github.com/blackhook/nessus-plugins/blob/64177d96abbb07c58cf7e131046b067ebc61fcb5/R/redhat-RHSA-2003-195.nasl","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--d6367848-57a2-4137-9590-6a4eee2a3194.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Exploit-List-Ja/blob/b82432e7d59d95db9f183c0cefa7744595784afa/2001.tsv","https://github.com/shamedgh/confine/blob/a75dad3ad336e6258a42cd1ce4af061eea68ed76/cve.files/cveToFile.json.t